{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;No forgiveness&quot;</strong> - horror game in the genre &quot;Simulator Walking&quot; and &quot;Psychological Horror&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plot:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No forgiveness is a psychological horror game where you wake up from your bed and discover that your wife and daughter are missing. As you are going to look for them, you gradually begin to realize that things aren't right. Something is trying to let you know that you are not alone and you are about to face fear, guilt and no forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The average duration of the game: 30-40 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An interesting and touching plot, which is presented in the notes and in the thoughts of the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The main genre of the game is &quot;walking simulator&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Jumpscares and terrible moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unreal Engine 5.6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATURE CONTENT DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe the content like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game contains scary scenes that may seem disturbing to some players</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER ANNOUNCEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been learning Unreal Engine software on my own, using only Youtube. Thanks to what I have learned in less than a year, I have completed my first project, titled &quot;No forgiveness&quot;.It would be a great honor if anybody finds my project likeable. Any feedback and support from you has a great importance, giving me the inspiration to start doing something even bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905340?t=1758347226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905340/262edd523156cebbb2e2e381d3a418f8db62cd1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758347226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905340/b3f4dfc602f52a8984dbee6238ee671cf87dc1c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758347226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905340/b3f4dfc602f52a8984dbee6238ee671cf87dc1c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758347226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;No forgiveness&quot;</strong> - horror game in the genre &quot;Simulator Walking&quot; and &quot;Psychological Horror&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plot:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No forgiveness is a psychological horror game where you wake up from your bed and discover that your wife and daughter are missing. As you are going to look for them, you gradually begin to realize that things aren't right. Something is trying to let you know that you are not alone and you are about to face fear, guilt and no forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The average duration of the game: 30-40 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An interesting and touching plot, which is presented in the notes and in the thoughts of the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The main genre of the game is &quot;walking simulator&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Jumpscares and terrible moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unreal Engine 5.6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATURE CONTENT DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe the content like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game contains scary scenes that may seem disturbing to some players</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER ANNOUNCEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been learning Unreal Engine software on my own, using only Youtube. Thanks to what I have learned in less than a year, I have completed my first project, titled &quot;No forgiveness&quot;.It would be a great honor if anybody finds my project likeable. Any feedback and support from you has a great importance, giving me the inspiration to start doing something even bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["VimmGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905340/ead942c9bd2f829358e822f9ce3d5c46fb3a3288/header.jpg?t=1758347226","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3905340/1176434864/a74f15a5e9b0bf82fdf9d1285d1fd6f9e68e12e1/1753546928/dash_av1.mpd?